00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.380
And then lastly,
the fifth pillar

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:40.520
that we focus and build process
technology and people skills

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:43.260
around is around our
operations and risk management.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:45.154
How do we actually
operate the platform,

00:03:45.154 --> 00:03:46.820
and how do we operate
the infrastructure

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:50.800
that you guys develop on for
success and for security?

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.820
The bulk of this
talk will be focused

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:54.510
on really three of these.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:57.410
The platform trust pieces
and underlying technologies

00:03:57.410 --> 00:03:58.970
