00:04:17.649 --> 00:04:19.829
We think about the
security stack at Google

00:04:19.829 --> 00:04:21.660
really in nine layers.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:23.520
And the core
philosophy of Google

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:28.660
has always been "Defense in
depth, at scale by default."

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:32.010
In other talks, previously we've
