00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:41.710
so that there's no
single point of failure.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.450
And then across each stack
layer as you go up and down

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:47.760
the stack, we have
multiple layers again

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:51.030
that prevent you from having
one single point of failure.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:55.180
For this talk, we're going to
