00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:25.420
Google loves containers.

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:28.440
We run a lot of things within
containers, including our VMs--

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:31.150
including everything in GCP.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:33.340
Containers really give us
